    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Assets are the files a team reuses alongside its written…",
      "text": "Assets are the files a team reuses alongside its written guidance: logos, palettes, fonts, images, audio, video and other files. They live in the same folder tree as Memory files at a workspace, product or project.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-2",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Assets are private. They are served only through access…",
      "text": "Assets are private. They are served only through access checks; there are no public links. To use an image on a public page, upload it to Grid instead—Grid has its own asset library, and publishing a page never draws from Memory.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "id": "markdown-3",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Upload and replace.",
      "text": "## Upload and replace.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Upload a file of up to 10 MiB. Its checksum is verified…",
      "text": "Upload a file of up to 10 MiB. Its checksum is verified before it becomes visible, and each upload becomes an immutable version. Uploading again replaces the asset with a new version, based on the version you started from; older versions stay in history.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-5",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Access works like files. The person who uploads an asset…",
      "text": "Access works like files. The person who uploads an asset gets Senior access to it. Junior access and propose-mode agents submit a replacement for review instead of applying it.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "id": "markdown-6",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Names, descriptions and tags.",
      "text": "## Names, descriptions and tags.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
