    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-7",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Seniors can rename an asset, add usage guidance and set…",
      "text": "Seniors can rename an asset, add usage guidance and set tags. Tags and a one-sentence description are suggested automatically from the filename, type and usage guidance—not from analyzing the file’s contents—and your own tags always win.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
      "fit": "cover",
      "shape": "rectangle",
      "hidden": false
    },
    {
      "padding": 0,
      "lineHeight": 1.5,
      "id": "markdown-8",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Supported images show a preview; other files are…",
      "text": "Supported images show a preview; other files are download-only. Uploaded files are never executed. Previews and thumbnails use a smaller version sized for where they are shown, made only after your access to the original is checked.",
      "assetId": null,
      "frame": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 1
      },
      "frames": {},
      "color": "transparent",
      "background": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "radius": 0,
      "align": "left",
